{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】葵涌一間中學6名學生疑被石屎擊傷，其中5人輕傷送院。</p>\n<p>學校有部分地方被圍板圍封，現場是安捷街裘錦秋中學。警方早上十時許接報，校內進行升降機工程期間，運送水泥的喉管破裂，5男1女的學生被石屎擊傷，其中5人送往瑪嘉烈醫院。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:44:01.503394+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T12:27:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:27.467176+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:27.467176+00:00","content_hash":"54fbc9669f739e134ed91e6ca3b2d5a74723b82f01d1298496fe02dede8ea13f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}